axis (size buckets null-to-wrong-signed) and is ~0 on the hindsight baskets (survivorship_gap -0.165). NOT a transferable 'members move together' law for arbitrary themes."],"residual_risks":["The clean 20d residual edge could itself be a longer-window (120d+) reversal/momentum-crash component the 20d/60d controls did not remove.","Single 2023-2026 macro regime \u2014 the whole effect may be a property of this regime; untestable on a 3y close-only cache.","Close-only (no volume): a true coordinated-inflow mechanism cannot be confirmed; cohesion may be capturing factor-beta compression in stress, not flow.","Largely a stress proxy \u2014 if combined later with the dashboard's existing VIX/stress signals it may be redundant (double-count risk)."]}}